_meanings:
A kind of {#hetvABAsa#} or fallacy in Nyāya,
 a subdivision of the {#anEkAntikahetvABAsa#}; {#vastumAtrapakzako'nupasaMhArI#}
 that is, that which includes every known thing in the {#pakza#} and thus
 prevents the corroboration of a general rule of causation by illustrations,
 positive or negative; as {#sarvaM nityaM prameyatvAt#}; {#atra sarvasyEva#}
 {#pakzatvAt prameyatvaM heturanupasaMhArI anvaye vyatireke vA dfzwAntABAvAt#}.
